Package: ti-adas-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: TI vision_apps RTOS firmware for j784s4-evm
 Pre-built RTOS firmware images for the heterogeneous cores on the TI
 J784S4 SoC: six R5F MCU cores (mcu2_0/1, mcu3_0/1, mcu4_0/1) and four
 C7x DSP cores.  These firmware images implement the RTOS side of the
 vision_apps OpenVX framework and must be loaded by the Linux remoteproc
 driver before any vision_apps or EdgeAI workloads can run.
 .
 Firmware files (.out) are installed to /usr/lib/firmware/vision_apps_evm/
 and symlinks are created at /usr/lib/firmware/ under the canonical
 remoteproc names (e.g. j784s4-main-r5f0_0-fw, j784s4-c71_0-fw).
 .
 Corresponds to: ti-adas-firmware (Yocto meta-edgeai, PSDK Analytics 11.02).
